python-pptx
-----------

The nine `pythonpptx-*.pptx` files in this folder are real test fixture files taken, unmodified,
from the `python-pptx` project's own test suite (see `README.md` in this same folder for the exact
source URL of each individual file). `python-pptx` is distributed under the MIT License, reproduced
below.

